# SmartSeat Edge Rules

You are working in `raspberrypi-edge/` only (Pi 5 runtime). PC backend/frontend live in other repo folders and may be absent on this machine.

## Read first

- `AGENTS.md`
- `docs/project-context.md`
- `docs/mqtt.md`
- `docs/flows.md`

## Hard constraints

- Device IDs: `raspi-a{n}` (e.g. `raspi-a1`)
- Broker: EMQX Cloud MQTT over TLS port 8883 via `.env`
- Do not put secrets in source; use `.env`
- Do not send video over MQTT
- Occupancy: ultrasonic is a candidate signal; face verify confirms sit/leave when possible
- Prefer small functions, type hints, named constants

## Scope

Implement sensors, camera, AI inference, seat monitoring, MQTT client under `src/`.
Do not invent PC REST APIs here unless documented in `docs/`.
